    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūkenaagūlwa kwa banishi ba Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyū gwene mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA kūlwa sī ya Isilaeli, ū SEEBA ūyo walyamba ī ligūlū, nū nsingi gwa sī ūgūtūūla we, hama hū ng'wene ū meeja wa moyo ūyo gūlī mu gatī ya ng'wa munhū; ū ng'wenūyo alīhaya gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ī Yelusalemu nakwīyīta ībize shikombe sha kūgenheleja kūlelengeta a mahanga ga banhū ayo galī hihī hihī; ī Yuda īkūpīndiwa, pyī nī Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo a mahanga ga mu sī a gose ūlū gibilinga kwilwisha nī Yelusalemu, nakwīyīta ībize iwe idito, īlo lītūdūla kūsegejiwa na mahanga gose. Abo bakūgema kwīsegeja bakwiminya boi benekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lwise lwenūlo būlī falasa nakwīgwisīja ng'hahū, na būlī ndamhīji wayo lūsalo.” Alīhaya SEEBA. Alīyo nakwikala miso kūlwa kwīlang'hana ī numba ya Yuda, ī falasa ja mahanga ī jene nakūjibbokuja pyī ī jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a batongeeji ba Yuda bakūhaya ū mu ng'holò jabo gīkī, “A banhū ba mu Yelusalemu balī na nguzu, nguno ū Seeba wa Būdūla bose hū ng'wene ū Mulungu wabo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo a batongeeji ba Yuda bakūbiza gītī moto gūkūmeenyaga h'ikīgo lya ng'hwi, nūūlū gītī chenge sha moto shilī ha shise sha būsīga būgesile. Bakūbanogoteja a banhū abo babapīndije, abo balī kū būlyo wabo nū kū lūmoso lwabo; alīyo ī Yelusalemu īkūsaaga h'ūmo īlī dūhū a h'ipande lyayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Seeba akūjipīja tame ī kaya ja mu Yuda, hūna lūūlū ī likūjo lya banhū ba numba ya ng'wa Daūdi na ba Yelusalemu lītūbiza itaale kūtinda ī lya banhū ba Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo ū Seeba akūbalang'hana a bikaji ba mu Yelusalemu, nīyo bakūbiza na nguzu no; ū ngokolo wa bagokolo ū mubo akūbiza gīt'ūmo walī Daūdi, ī numba ya ng'wa Daūdi īkūbiza gītī Mulungu, gītī Malaika o ng'wa Seeba alī kū būtongi wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo nakūfuma naje nakūgakenaagūlaga a mahanga a gose ayo gakwīdumīlaga ī Yelusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūnīlīīla Ūyo bakanchima",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nīyo ī numba ya ng'wa Daūdi na a bikaji ba mu Yelusalemu nakūbitīīla Moyo wa shigongo na wa kūbagunanha kūlomba mu kwikūmbīlīja. Bakūnilola, ū nene ūyo bakanichima, hūna bakūlīla gītī munhū akūnīlaga ng'wana wakwe ūmò dūhū, hangī bakūpīnīhala no gītī kūpīnīhala kwa munhū kūlwa ng'wana wakwe ngosha tangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo kūkūbiza ho kūlīla kūtaale no ū mu Yelusalemu, gītī kūlīla kwa mu sī ya Hadadi-limoni kū mbūga ya Megido. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī sī īkūlīla ng'hūngū, nīyo būlī banhū mu lūdūgū lwabo, na a bake babo nabo būlī bene heke heke, a ba lūdūgū lwa numba ya ng'wa Daūdi na a bake babo, na a ba lūdūgū lwa numba ya ng'wa Nasani na a bake babo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na a ba lūdūgū lwa numba ya ng'wa Lawī na a bake babo, na a ba lūdūgū lwa numba ya ng'wa Shimei na a bake babo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nī ndūgū ījo jilīsaagīīla najo na a bake baajo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
